{"4613110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "High Walk", "steam_appid": 4613110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wake up on a high platform over roofs of skyscrapers.</strong> Your goal is to reach the suitcase with a million dollars. And stay alive in the process. Fight intense frost and keep balance walking on ropes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613110/extras/190f7cac2d0ea616b1c850663aa996d9.avif?t=1776339519\" alt=\"\"width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Several platforms have heaters to keep you warm. </strong>But to activate one you will have to pass a password to your dumbass mate via diffrent ways of communication. Siren speaker, Morse code or even a simple paper plane - use anything to get your message delivered and activate the heater!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game features complex communication</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >proximity chat with environmental changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >speaker that delivers your voice on long distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >light switches, to communicate even in heavy wind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >paper planes to deliver notes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613110/extras/db16ab8aca2cdd03f8409bb21c908ba8.avif?t=1776339519\" alt=\"\"width=1018 height=960 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wake up on a high platform over roofs of skyscrapers.</strong> Your goal is to reach the suitcase with a million dollars. And s